Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 12:49:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 21/30] fix(focus): project successful public agent focus to
 clients

Backport herdrdev/herdr@ec338ce01a1e8fa5217c0cfd46fcfb83d93257f2. Resolve the agent after pending events, use the shared public-focus path, and keep failed requests local to their error result.

Refs herdrdev/herdr#3764, herdrdev/herdr#3760.
---
 src/server/headless/client_views.rs |  34 ++++++--
 src/server/headless/tests/mod.rs    | 128 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 155 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

